                                                "sense_id": "a904b830-99f2-335b-99e2-0d77aa8a81f2",
                                                "text": "After taking off their shoes, socks and sandals at the doorway, the kids were barefoot."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "67f8b59a-a3cb-4751-ba7d-64f6b34d1e8f",
                                                "sense_id": "a904b830-99f2-335b-99e2-0d77aa8a81f2",
                                                "text": "[L]ike Hedg-hogs vvhich / Lye tumbling in my bare-foote vvay, and mount / Their pricks at my foot-fall: ſometime am I / All vvound vvith Adders, vvho vvith clouen tongues / Doe hiſſe me into madneſſe: […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "07f5c2aa-a2c5-4471-85e3-33bbe5ad6c43",
                                                "sense_id": "a904b830-99f2-335b-99e2-0d77aa8a81f2",
                                                "text": "It was firm enough to walk on, but Bradly took off his boots to preserve the leather from sea-water, and for the pleasure of barefoot walking on cool sand."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8b388948-cb8e-3a88-819a-dbc215682d20",
